{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/15_animation/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"transition\" style=\"position:relative;\">Transition<a href=\"#transition\" aria-label=\"transition permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>vue에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">&lt;Transition></code>을 이용하면 애니메이션을 쉽게 줄 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;Transition name=&quot;fade&quot;&gt;\r\n\t&lt;!-- 애니메이션 주고 싶은 요소 --&gt;\r\n&lt;/Transition&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* 등장 */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-enter-from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* 시작 스타일 */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-enter-active</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> all .5s<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-enter-to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>1<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* 끝 스타일 */</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">/* 퇴장 */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-leave-from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* 시작 스타일 */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-leave-active</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> all .5s<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-leave-to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>1<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token comment\">/* 끝 스타일 */</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"예제\" style=\"position:relative;\">예제<a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"예제 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;Transition name=&quot;fade&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;modal_wrap black-bg&quot; v-if=&quot;모달창열렸니==1&quot;&gt;\r\n      &lt;div class=&quot;white-bg&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;img :src=&quot;원룸들[누른거].image&quot; class=&quot;room-img&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;h4&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].title }}&lt;/h4&gt;\r\n        &lt;p&gt;{{ 원룸들[누른거].content }}&lt;/p&gt;\r\n        &lt;div&gt;개월 수 : &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; v-model=&quot;month&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n        &lt;p&gt;[{{month}}개월 선택] {{ 원룸들[누른거].price * month }}원&lt;/p&gt;\r\n        &lt;button @click=&quot;closeModal&quot;&gt;닫기&lt;/button&gt;\r\n      &lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/Transition&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.fade-enter-from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-enter-active</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>all .3s<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-enter-to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>1<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-leave-from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>1<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-leave-active</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">transition</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>all .3s<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">.fade-leave-to</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token property\">opacity</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>애니메이션 만들 때 vue 문법이 굳이 필요하진 않다. (CSS로 가능)<br>\nCSS로 애니메이션을 주려면</p>\n<ol>\n<li>시작 전 class 명</li>\n<li>애니메이션 끝난 후 class</li>\n<li>원할 때 2번의 class 부착</li>\n</ol>\n<p>어떤 조건일 때 특정 클래스를 넣고 싶으면<br>\n<code class=\"language-text\">{ 클래스명 : 조건 }</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">&lt;div class=&quot;modal&quot; :class=&quot;{ end : true }&quot;&gt;\r\n\r\n&lt;div class=&quot;modal_wrap open black-bg&quot; :class=&quot;{ modal_open : 모달창열렸니 }&quot; v-if=&quot;모달창열렸니==1&quot;&gt;\r\n...\r\n&lt;/div&gt;</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#transition\">Transition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\">예제</a></li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"15. animation, Transition (class명 조건부로 넣기)","summary":"Transition vue에서는 <Transition>을 이용하면 애니메이션을 쉽게 줄 수 있다. <Transition name=\"fade\"><!-- 애니메이션 주고 싶은 요소 --> </Transition> /* 등장 */ .fade-enter-from{ opacity:0; } /* 시작 스타일 */ .fade-enter-active{ transition: all .5s;","date":"Jun 16, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/15_animation/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/14_watcher/","title":"14. 데이터 감시 watcher"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/16_데이터_정렬과_보존/","title":"16. 데이터 정렬과 데이터 보존 sort() [...array]"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}